    <status>Active</status>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>textTemplate_EmailBody</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Hello,

This is an automated follow-up reminder for Opportunity: {!$Record.Name} (Account: {!$Record.Account.Name}).

This deal has had no logged activity for 7 or more days. A follow-up task has been assigned to you in Salesforce.

Details:
- Stage: {!$Record.StageName}
- Amount: {!$Record.Amount}
- Close Date: {!$Record.CloseDate}

Please review the record and reach out to the customer to keep the opportunity moving forward.

Thank you,
Sales Automation Flow</text>
    </textTemplates>
</Flow>
